      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "Pinecone (first)",
      "sub": "loose pages · verse",
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "armored and pronged waiting to drop\npacked tight like a hand grenade\nto only explode in a forest fire\nwhen everything else has fled for dear life."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "its shrapnel litters the carpet ashen floor\nthis desolate unmade graveyard wasteland\nlying in wait for however long it takes\nto be the first to seed new life."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "and grow above the rest."
    },
